  "description": "Taraf is a smooth and modern gourmand fragrance that blends juicy fruits with soft florals and a creamy sweet base. The scent feels elegant, slightly playful, and well-balanced, offering a clean fruity opening with a warm, comforting dry-down. The opening introduces a bright blend of pear and red fruits, creating a juicy, sweet, and inviting first impression. The heart develops into jasmine and orange blossom, adding a soft floral layer that brings freshness and elegance to the composition. The base settles into vanilla, praline, and musk, leaving a warm, creamy, and long-lasting trail that feels sweet, cozy, and slightly addictive. Taraf is perfect for those who enjoy fruity-floral gourmand fragrances with a smooth vanilla sweetness and a clean musky finish.",
